 "description": "PAID ($0.0027 USDC via x402). Who holds an ERC-20: the top 10 holders with their share of supply and whether each is a contract (a pool, bridge or vault), locked, or a burn address; the LP holders and how much LP is locked; the creator's and owner's own share; the holder count; and concentration both raw (top10Pct) and with burned/locked supply left out (top10ControlledPct). Base by default, also ethereum, polygon, arbitrum, optimism, bsc, avalanche. Send no body to get USDC on Base. Without payment this returns the 402 challenge; the fiatdock-mcp npm package pays automatically. Any answer the tool cannot produce is >= 400 and is NOT charged.",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
